🚧 Challenges Overcome
1. Account Ownership Conflicts
Issue: PDAs were being created as system accounts, not token accounts

Solution: Used init_if_needed with proper token constraints to ensure accounts become valid TokenAccounts

2. Seed Synchronization
Issue: Mismatched seeds between program and scripts caused PDA derivation failures

Solution: Standardized on "solana_treasury_solana_v4" and "nagus_vault_solana_v5" across all files

3. Fee Transfer Failures
Issue: Second transfer to vault failed with InvalidAccountData

Solution: Temporarily commented out fee logic to validate core bridge functionality; vault will be upgraded to proper token account in next phase

4. LayerZero Handshake
Issue: Base Hub needed to trust Solana program

Solution: Executed setPeer on Base Sepolia with Solana program ID converted to bytes32

